
[[Category:Place]] 

The old Hydro-Plant is a massive concrete structure originally built to harness mountain runoff. However, it has been secretly repurposed by the Cathedral as the prototype facility for Project Eclipse. Critically, this plant remains hyper-functional, providing the necessary electricity to half of the entire Fondent Region. Heavily secured by the Nimrod division, the site serves as a testing ground and a secret logistics hub, linking the remote mountain region to the greater Cathedral infrastructure. The atmosphere is one of cold efficiency, where the humming dynamos mask the disturbing nature of the experiments taking place under intense security.

